  "system": "combat",
  "note": "What a server sends to mark that a unit is attacking a champion, or to take the mark away. The header names the unit. A client marks the unit where target is nonzero, names a champion the client holds and the unit is on the other side, drawing an indicator on the unit's health bar unless the unit's data turns it off; any other target clears the mark. TargetUnit draws the targeting beam and never touches this mark.",
